/target/
# An example's own (its playtest history, `target/playtest-history/`).
/examples/*/target/
**/*.rs.bk
*.snap.new
# A reference picture a test drew anew, to look at before it replaces the old.
*.new.png
*.pending-snap
__pycache__/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Distribution / packaging output
/dist/

# Python's own, beside the tools' scripts.
__pycache__/

# Test & quality tooling output
/mutants.out/
/mutants.out.old/
lcov.info
*.profraw
*.profdata

# The website, as `zola build` writes it (site/README.md).
/site/public/
# The problem codes' pages, written from crates/cli/errors/ by site/errors.sh.
/site/content/learn/errors/
# The changelog and the release posts `cargo xtask changelog --site` writes
# (ticket 2804); `pages.yml` makes them when it builds.
/site/content/changelog.md
/site/content/news/generated/
# The feature cards' statuses `cargo xtask site-data --site site` makes from
# the tickets they name (ticket 2815); `pages.yml` and CI make them.
/site/data/tickets.toml
# Hello, Grid's files the playground edits, which site/copy-playground.sh
# copies from examples/hello-grid/files/ (ticket 2814).
/site/static/playground/
